      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Omite 'out on your own'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2892c2",
      "back_en": "Ah, what orderly and swift movements! It's",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x289320",
      "back_en": "I suppose it's not for nothing you're called Soyankekur the Mariner!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Suposhto' erro de grafia; frase reestruturada/completada."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x289352",
      "back_en": "nothing. My father praised you as a worthy rival.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel (divisão de linha)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2895ae",
      "back_en": "cast off from port!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'largue do porto' náutico aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x289ba0",
      "back_en": "if they knew...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x28b612",
      "back_en": "Need something?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x28b68f",
      "back_en": "It's more important to be with you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
