      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x28eabb",
      "back_en": "plaguing me recently, I must say.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x28eb44",
      "back_en": "I have high hopes for you, indeed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x28ec61",
      "back_en": "I like sweets.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x285ebc",
      "back_en": "We leave the imperial capital and head straight",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
