      "offset": "0x286486",
      "back_en": "Not a word about Tuskur since we left. Kuon",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x286a72",
      "back_en": "What could that be? Are they going to pack",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x287054",
      "back_en": "We grab our slices of rintan and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Linha incompleta, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x287595",
      "back_en": "Pretty cool, eh? As it ripens,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
